/ ============================================================
/ main.mas
/ Starter MARIE program scaffold.
/ ============================================================

ORG 100

Main,       JnS Initialise
            JnS Process
            Halt

Initialise, HEX 000
            Load Zero
            Store Result
            JumpI Initialise

Process,    HEX 000
            Load One
            Store Result
            JumpI Process

Zero,       DEC 0
One,        DEC 1
Result,     DEC 0

END
